<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL MAY NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL MAY NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.53 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.68 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.77 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Sales		   13.39 vs  11.72</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.39 vs   0.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.60 vs   1.31</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.41 vs   2.84</p>
<p> Sales		   61.66 vs  52.72</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry producer is Olsztynskie</p>
<p>Zaklady Drobiarskie Indykpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
